@startuml
' Authored fixture (svg-sprite-nanoparser, 2026-07-30).
' Sprites come from the stdlib bundle via !include -- the form a user
' actually writes (si8 T6). This fixture previously inlined the `sprite
' <name> <svg ...>` declarations because the golden harness (renderFixture)
' ran the preprocessor with NO include resolver; si8 T5 wired one in, so
' that workaround is gone.
' Two sprites with an IDENTICAL declared 16x16 box but different drawn ink:
' bi-globe's outer circle is an ARC and UPath.addInternal records only an
' arc's endpoint, so it inks 16x13.846; bi-bootstrap-fill inks the full box.
' Pins declared-vs-ink channel independence at the golden level.
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor white

!include <bootstrap/bootstrap>

usecase a as "<$bi-globe>"
usecase b as "<$bi-bootstrap-fill>"
usecase c as "<$bi-globe,scale=2.5>"
usecase d as "<$bi-bootstrap-fill,scale=2.5>"
@enduml
